rite-offer-material = a length of material (a rod or sheet)
rite-offer-battery = something that holds a charge
rite-offer-paper = a sheet of paper
rite-offer-produce = a piece of fresh produce
rite-offer-bulb = a light bulb
rite-offer-organ = an organ
rite-offer-core = an anomaly core

rite-wand-name = Rite of the Wand
rite-wand-desc = A length of material and a spark become an empty wand, ready to be bound.
rite-clarity-name = Rite of Clarity
rite-clarity-desc = Three pages of writing are burnt for what they knew. You learn a glyph you did not know.
rite-recollection-name = Rite of Recollection
rite-recollection-desc = You remember two prepared spells you had forgotten.
rite-attunement-name = Rite of Attunement
rite-attunement-desc = Living things and borrowed light. You are attuned to a school you were not. Its glyphs cost you less.
rite-road-name = Rite of the Road
rite-road-desc = A part of someone, and what they wrote. You learn a way of working magic you did not have.
rite-refilling-name = Rite of Refilling
rite-refilling-desc = Stored charge poured back into the Winds. Restores Wind.
rite-deck-name = Rite of the Deck
rite-deck-desc = Two sheets of paper become three tarot cards.
rite-light-name = Rite of Light
rite-light-desc = Two bulbs become three small, borrowed lights.
rite-storm-name = Rite of Storm
rite-storm-desc = An anomaly core feeds a storm that breaks around the circle.
rite-fire-name = Rite of Fire
rite-fire-desc = Fresh growth feeds a wide fire around the circle.
rite-mending-name = Rite of Mending
rite-mending-desc = Growth and writing become a wide, strong healing around the circle.
rite-carp-name = Rite of Carp
rite-carp-desc = A part of someone is traded for a shoal of hostile carp.

ritual-circle-name = ritual circle
ritual-circle-desc = A circle of lines that do not sit flat. Things laid inside it are noticed.
ritual-error-no-circle = You need to stand near your ritual circle.
ritual-error-offerings = The circle is missing what the rite asks for.
ritual-error-busy = The circle is already working.
ritual-error-interrupted = The rite is broken. Nothing happens.
ritual-begin = The circle begins to hum.
ritual-learn-glyph = You learn the glyph {$glyph}.
ritual-learn-nothing = There was nothing left for the Winds to teach you.
ritual-learn-discipline = You learn a new way of working magic: {$discipline}.
ritual-learn-rote = You remember the prepared spell {$rote}.
ritual-attune = You are now attuned to {$school}.
ritual-wind = Wind floods back into you.
ritual-circle-drawn = You draw a ritual circle.

tarot-title-upright = {$numeral} - {$name}
tarot-title-reversed = {$numeral} - {$name} (Reversed)
tarot-draw-cooldown = The deck is not ready to be drawn from again yet.
tarot-drawn = You draw {$card}.
